   "slogan": "AI, deployed into your business and kept working.",
   "description": "lumic is a custom AI implementation firm in St. Louis, Missouri. Its Forward Deployed Engineers (FDEs) build AI into any process, in any system a business runs, and keep it working on a monthly retainer. A person on the client's team approves what matters. It fits any business with repetitive work done by hand, for example manufacturers, distributors and service firms. In production: an AP agent reads each vendor bill from email, matches it to the purchase order and enters it once a person approves. The bills it can't match go to a person with the reason. Live in weeks, not quarters.",
   "disambiguatingDescription": "lumic (get-lumic.com) is a St. Louis AI implementation firm. It is not lumic.ai, Lumiq, Lumicera, Lumico or getlumic.com.",
