     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Does lumic work on site in St. Louis?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Yes. lumic is based in St. Louis, and its Forward Deployed Engineers work beside your team at your place of business, by appointment."
