   "description": "lumic's Forward Deployed Engineers (FDEs) work on site, build one custom AI agent at a time inside the systems a business already runs, and stay to keep it working. A person approves every entry before it posts."
  },
  {
   "@type": "FAQPage",
   "@id": "https://get-lumic.com/forward-deployed-engineers/small-business/#faq",
   "mainEntity": [
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Is an FDE a fit for a smaller business?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Yes. A Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) fits a business with people doing repetitive work by hand, that wants it done inside the systems the team already uses, with a person approving what matters. A smaller business gets the same on-site build and the same team that stays to run it."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "How is an FDE different from a hire or a software license?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "lumic does not sell software to configure yourself. lumic’s Forward Deployed Engineers build the agent inside the systems you already run, and the team stays to run it for a monthly fee. A person on your team approves every entry before it posts."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "What does it cost to start?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Free consultation. On-site work $1,500/day, credited toward phase one. Managed AI from $250 to $5,000 a month, depending on scope. Final pricing depends on your workflow and systems. These figures are starting points, not quotes."
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "@type": "WebPage",
   "@id": "https://get-lumic.com/faq/#webpage",
   "url": "https://get-lumic.com/faq/",
